// The angles whose sine, cosine and tangent a number is,
// ported from musl's libm by way of the `libm` crate, which keep FreeBSD's
// msun, which is Sun's fdlibm:
//
// ====================================================
// Copyright (C) 1993 by Sun Microsystems, Inc. All rights reserved.
